{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/901e8a7f903c5ea3b5f4183d4c5b11f4.poster.avif?t=1770282098\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/901e8a7f903c5ea3b5f4183d4c5b11f4.webm?t=1770282098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/901e8a7f903c5ea3b5f4183d4c5b11f4.mp4?t=1770282098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Time To Wake Up is an atmospheric psychological thriller where one night you find yourself stuck in a dream. No worries, though. You are not alone. You hear a voice, in need of your eyes and willing to help you out.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blinking is thinking</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/4118eb5dad8319eb8563d3d681414d30.poster.avif?t=1770282098\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/4118eb5dad8319eb8563d3d681414d30.webm?t=1770282098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/4118eb5dad8319eb8563d3d681414d30.mp4?t=1770282098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your sight is your light at the end of the tunnel. Blink and rearrange your surroundings, reset all motion, flood whole rooms, or turn them around.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traverse your memories</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/9f1615576ae591aff6ee022af9f84e2e.poster.avif?t=1770282098\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/9f1615576ae591aff6ee022af9f84e2e.webm?t=1770282098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/9f1615576ae591aff6ee022af9f84e2e.mp4?t=1770282098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Even with your sight, even if you're not alone, do watch your step. Your dream can be foggy. You never know what exactly is around the corner during your trip down memory lane.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the shadows of your past</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/e1423fb70f06ceace19d3ee6047ae482.poster.avif?t=1770282098\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/e1423fb70f06ceace19d3ee6047ae482.webm?t=1770282098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/e1423fb70f06ceace19d3ee6047ae482.mp4?t=1770282098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Didn't we already warn you to watch your step? Do watch it before it falls off the stairs or other dark places your mind might take you to!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >School is cool</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/84d4d4a847389b6a643a7fb9d063d891.poster.avif?t=1770282098\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/84d4d4a847389b6a643a7fb9d063d891.webm?t=1770282098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/84d4d4a847389b6a643a7fb9d063d891.mp4?t=1770282098\" 